{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16999","headline":"酬陆员外歙州许员外郢州二使君 · 武元衡","name":"酬陆员外歙州许员外郢州二使君","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"吴洲云海接，楚驿梦林长。\n符节分忧重，鵷鸿去路翔。\n艳歌愁翠黛，宝瑟韵清商。\n洲草遥池合，春风晓斾张。\n晋臣多乐广，汉主识冯唐。\n不作经年别，离魂亦未伤。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"武元衡","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_16999.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16999","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}